{"overview":"به ریوپول، مشهورترین دراگ‌کوئین جهان، بپیوندید؛ او به‌عنوان میزبان، مربی و قاضی در بزرگ‌ترین مسابقهٔ دراگ‌کوئین‌ها حضور دارد. برترین دراگ‌کوئین‌های ایالات متحده برای به دست آوردن ستاره‌دانی دراگ رقابت می‌کنند، در حالی که ریوپول با لباس‌های گلامازون کامل، در تمام قضاوت‌ها و حذف‌ها سلطه دارد و به شرکت‌کنندگان در آماده‌سازی برای هر چالش راهنمایی می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Join RuPaul, the world's most famous drag queen, as the host, mentor and judge for the ultimate in drag queen competitions. The top drag queens in the U.S. will vie for drag stardom as RuPaul, in full glamazon drag, will reign supreme in all judging and eliminations while helping guide the contestants as they prepare for each challenge.","tagline_en":"In shady times, let there be light.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":43,"y":2009,"poster":"/yFNqE91JmhQzpGjWWpgozK0xRTl.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":9,"y":2009,"poster":"/n4DAi3PBp7fsRMRf8VXKk6pT1Cc.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":12,"y":2010,"poster":"/ejy05NVupvoOm1YaaqJCK0TGVX8.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":16,"y":2011,"poster":"/skuRDaRlOwVQhkfpVD0EJVaIPbK.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":14,"y":2012,"poster":"/bEujjc2ZXUbJO32GZ4uMQWOlQuS.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":14,"y":2013,"poster":"/mRiKVOY6NMZlvxSTcYbarO7MJR8.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":14,"y":2014,"poster":"/u8fN42R2sgxRGqNyBFj17GO3Hxa.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":14,"y":2015,"poster":"/45OSv4nvaGliItfODO9JTMCtnRO.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":10,"y":2016,"poster":"/ntBL9REggTUwg8m5lNLx4Pg4L3E.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":14,"y":2017,"poster":"/q0yflinvldIBvJYV9GNW73rF6yv.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":14,"y":2018,"poster":"/aysMLBFqnOM6iL7HdCXwGdpR9Mi.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":14,"y":2019,"poster":"/x0MPibraxaqbk6cwgjxJnvOFntC.jpg"},{"n":12,"name":"فصل 12","ep":14,"y":2020,"poster":"/e3Y1jNEJvqHcSNKI6iqO9DStPXm.jpg"},{"n":13,"name":"فصل 13","ep":16,"y":2021,"poster":"/1a7nBLw0a